and the BigBlueButton Logo are trademarks of\nBigBlueButton Inc\n.\nAbout\nA complete web conferencing system for virtual classes and more!\nbigbluebutton.org\nTopics\nbigbluebutton\ncollaboration\nconferencing\nvideo\nvideo-conferencing\nwebrtc\nResources\nReadme\nLGPL-3.0 license\nSecurity policy\nSecurity policy\nActivity\nCustom properties\nStars\n9.2k\nstars\nWatchers\n380\nwatching\nForks\n6.0k\nforks\nReport repository\nReleases\nPackages\nUsed by\nContributors\nLanguages\nFooter\n© 2026 GitHub, Inc.\nFooter navigation\nTerms\nPrivacy\nSecurity\nStatus\nCommunity\nDocs\nContact\nManage cookies\nDo not share my personal information\nYou can’t perform that action at this time.",
